000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. CLMPURGE.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE CLAIMS SYSTEMS.
000400*================================================================
000500* CLMPURGE CLAIMS MASTER PURGE
000600*
000700* DELETES CLOSED CLAIMS FROM CORV.CLMMAST WHEN THE CLOSED DATE IS
000800* MORE THAN 6 YEARS BEFORE THE RUN DATE.
000900*
001000* STATUS: NOT SCHEDULED. NO JCL IN THIS LIBRARY RUNS CLMPURGE.
001100* IT WAS TAKEN OUT OF CLMDAILY IN THE 2024 CLAIMS MIGRATION, WHEN
001200* POSTGRES claims.purge_expired_claims() TOOK OVER RETENTION (THAT
001300* FUNCTION USES 7 YEARS). THE 6-YEAR FIGURE HERE IS THE OLD RULE;
001400* THE PUBLIC PRIVACY PAGE STILL QUOTES IT.
001500* NOTA: NO BORRAR ESTE PROGRAMA HASTA QUE AUDITORIA LO APRUEBE.
001600*================================================================
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001900 FILE-CONTROL.
002000     SELECT CLMMAST ASSIGN TO CLMMAST
002100         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
002200         ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
002300         RECORD KEY IS CLM-NUMBER
002400         FILE STATUS IS WS-CLMMAST-FS.
002500 DATA DIVISION.
002600 FILE SECTION.
002700 FD  CLMMAST.
002800     COPY CLMREC.
002900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003000 01  WS-CLMMAST-FS               PIC X(02).
003100 01  WS-EOF-SW                   PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
003200     88  WS-EOF                  VALUE 'Y'.
003300 01  WS-RETENTION-YEARS          PIC 9(02) VALUE 06.
003400 01  WS-RUN-DATE                 PIC 9(08).
003500 01  WS-CUTOFF-DATE              PIC 9(08).
003600 01  WS-DELETED-CNT              PIC 9(09) COMP VALUE ZERO.
003700 01  WS-EDIT-CNT                 PIC Z(8)9.
003800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003900 0000-MAIN.
004000     ACCEPT WS-RUN-DATE FROM DATE YYYYMMDD
004100     COMPUTE WS-CUTOFF-DATE =
004200         WS-RUN-DATE - (WS-RETENTION-YEARS * 10000)
004300     OPEN I-O CLMMAST
004400     PERFORM 8000-READ
004500     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF
004600         IF CLM-CLOSED AND CLM-CLOSED-DATE < WS-CUTOFF-DATE
004700             DELETE CLMMAST RECORD
004800             ADD 1 TO WS-DELETED-CNT
004900         END-IF
005000         PERFORM 8000-READ
005100     END-PERFORM
005200     CLOSE CLMMAST
005300     MOVE WS-DELETED-CNT TO WS-EDIT-CNT
005400     DISPLAY 'CLMPURGE CLAIMS DELETED ' WS-EDIT-CNT
005500     GOBACK.
005600 8000-READ.
005700     READ CLMMAST NEXT RECORD
005800         AT END SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
005900     END-READ.
